      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017. Published by Elsevier Masson SAS.",
        "AbstractText": "The goal of this article is to provide a systemic approach to forehead rejuvenation. Fillers, botulinic toxin injections, transpalpebral, endoscopic or bicoronal brow lift must be usual techniques for every plastic surgeon in overall facial rejuvenation. Achieving a long lasting and aesthetically pleasing forehead is possible only with surgical techniques when aging is obvious."
      },
